{"2720730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Our Journey: The Silent Voice", "steam_appid": 2720730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/d2152b7c5db813624403e3ce7af39d7b.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a unique co-op journey with a friend.</strong> <br>Play two different roles: the Hero and his Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate throughout your journey to find the artifacts that will bring you together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/24c1c5c0ebc194502864ce9c2a61aeba.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Spirit:</strong> Guide your partner through the world by playing symbols cards.<br><strong>Body:</strong> Determine your destination by comparing the received cards to the environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/e78d5a84661d639e3753bea9a5d9a75a.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate without talking, communicate with the cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your vocabulary:</strong> Symbols cards.<br><strong>Your grammar:</strong> Artifacts allowing new card manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/c32edbc96647a5f886b90dad7bd0f14e.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover other civilisations and beautiful places.<br>Your encounters will help you understand this enigmatic world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/d2152b7c5db813624403e3ce7af39d7b.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a unique co-op journey with a friend.</strong> <br>Play two different roles: the Hero and his Spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate throughout your journey to find the artifacts that will bring you together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/24c1c5c0ebc194502864ce9c2a61aeba.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Spirit:</strong> Guide your partner through the world by playing symbols cards.<br><strong>Body:</strong> Determine your destination by comparing the received cards to the environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/e78d5a84661d639e3753bea9a5d9a75a.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate without talking, communicate with the cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your vocabulary:</strong> Symbols cards.<br><strong>Your grammar:</strong> Artifacts allowing new card manipulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/extras/c32edbc96647a5f886b90dad7bd0f14e.avif?t=1769264954\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover other civilisations and beautiful places.<br>Your encounters will help you understand this enigmatic world.</p>", "short_description": "Our Journey: The Silent Voice is a co-op (2 players) asymmetric adventure game. Communicate creatively with symbols to unveil the path to success. Find out who you really are by meeting intriguing characters and visiting new places.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Italian, Russian, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/e184d95791c6ba28adf5034dedb54ca08987a7ed/header.jpg?t=1769264954", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/dd968fe33fb486609787c51e1e8d0af86efd7efb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769264954", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2720730/dd968fe33fb486609787c51e1e8d0af86efd7efb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769264954", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 7th gen<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or above<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirem